      "content": "so you're saying it's basically just a cover for geopolitical interests. if that's the case, isn't it pretty much a fact that sanctions are just a tool of imperialism rather than a legitimate diplomatic tool? i mean, if the outcome is almost always more suffering for the people and more power for the dictator, how can anyone still justify calling them \"effective\"?",
